window.products.push({"id":1143116,"name":"Faux Pampas Grass 6PCS 31inch,Artificial Tall Pampas Grass Decor for Floor Vase,Bunny Tail Fluffy Large Pampas Grass Bouquet Home Wedding Farmhouse Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qu2YVyfcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality Pampas Grass】The feather plumes are made of high quality silk while the stems are made with iron wire wrapped in rustic brown paper to give the appearance of dried pompus grass fall stems. Each set has been hand crafted, please take it out of the package carefully and give each reed a gentle shake. You can put the large pampas grass under the sun for a few hours to make it fluffy before use. 【No Shedding Material】The tall pampas grass is made of adjustable metal wire, paper and silk, and feather flower is made of high-quality silk cloth material. Different from natural dried pampas grass, artificial pampas grass is not easy to fall off, does not deform, is fluffy and dense, is easy to manage. It presents a natural appearance of pampas grass. No odor, no allergen! Therefore, it is more suitable for families with children or pets. 【Fits any Vase DIY】Handpicked 6 faux pompass grasses. You also can shorten the length of the pampas grass bouquet to adapt to your vase, so as to achieve your satisfactory decoration needs. Creating fullness and an interesting texture for your boho home decor. Let you enjoy the fun of DIY and feel the real natural atmosphere. Pampas grass has a comfortable hand feeling, soft and fluffy that is the best choice for home decor as a vase filler. 【Faux Tall Pampas Grass】Faux pampas grass total length is 31 inches, feather is 17.7 inches long, the stem can be bent to fit any size vase. Each stem is fluffy, full, soft, aesthetic and luxurious addition for whom enjoy vintage or modern greenery decor. Soft and fluffy plumes add a touch of chic and bohemian look to your home. Perfect for wedding, dining table, living room, entrance, bedroom, office and party decoration. 【One-of-a-kind Decorations】This dried pampas grass is perfect for creating spectacular floral centerpieces for weddings, special events or home décor. An excellent choice for DIY projects, bridal bouquets, table arrangements. Pampas grass flower language is hope, loyalty, eternity, happy reunion. Tall Pampass grass decor has a free-spirited vibe and comfortable feel, soft and fluffy that is a good choice for indoor and outdoor decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qu2YVyfcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gunlar","source_asin":"B09WDVXRR6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WDVXRR6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WDVXRR6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1143117,"name":"SheetKart Crying Wolf to the Moon Tapestry Wall Hanging, Howling Wolf Tapestries Blue, Indian Cotton Printed Hippie Bohemian Hippy Small Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r34YmDNgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wolves Howling at the Moon Mythology and the imagination of the masses have created a popular belief that there is some sort of connection between wolves and the moon - that when the wild canines howl, it’s directly and deliberately at the Earth’s natural satellite. It’s a romantic concept, for sure - one we certainly enjoy telling the kids - but hardly the case in reality. The presence of the moon when a wolf howls, as it turns out, is purely coincidental and circumstantial. Canine experts have found no connection between the phases of the moon and wolf howling. Wolves pipe up more often during the night because they're nocturnal. But why do they point their faces toward the moon and stars when they howl? It's all about acoustics, since projecting their calls upward allows the sound to carry farther. There are emotional rationales that have been put forth for howling of the wolves - that it expresses restlessness, anxiety, stress, frustration, loneliness, and excitement. The more we learn about wolves, the more complex and human-like they seem to become. Recent research has found that wolves howl most frequently to the members of their packs they spend the most time with. That sounds an awful lot like best friends chatting about their day. Keeping this divine concept of wolves in mind, SheetKart with its in-house manufacturing unit has tried to showcase a product depicting this beautiful concept of this nocturnal animal in a Wall Hanging which will décor the walls and living area of your home in the most pleasing way. This gorgeous Wolf Howling at the Moon and Stars wall art is hand-crafted in India. The process involves hundreds of humans working at every step to create this fantastic product which takes almost 200 hours of workmanship. With years of our ancestral experience, we are a company of young people trying to bridge the gap of being traditional along with being unconventional.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81r34YmDNgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SheetKart","source_asin":"B078V7MMVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078V7MMVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078V7MMVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
