window.products.push({"id":1143153,"name":"Admetior Stainless Steel Digital Spoon Scale with 2 Spoons, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nH+s7iaeL._AC_.jpg","description":"Digital Spoon Scale is a revolutionary way to measure ingredients. It has a Stainless Steel housing with a detachable scoop for easy cleaning and can measure up to an accumulative 105-ounce with a one time measure of 10-ounce. It has a hold and tare function. The Spoon Scale can read in grams or ounces. It comes with two scoops a teaspoon and a table spoon. The Spoon Scale comes in blue or black.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nH+s7iaeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Admetior","source_asin":"B003C9OG2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003C9OG2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003C9OG2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1143154,"name":"SATVIK 4 inch Lakshmi Ganesha Statue Metal Figurine Laxmi Ganesh Idol Murti Set for Hindu Pooja for Home Mandir Indian Diwali Puja Pujan Decoration. I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lueUCG25L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lakshmi Ganesha – The Hindi word ‘Chaturbhuj’ means the one who has four hands. In this brass sculpture Lord Ganesha is depicted with his four hands. The upper left hand has a ‘Pharsa’ or an axe symbolizing cutting attachment bonds. The lower right hand is raised with palm facing outwards away from the body with fingers flexed. This hand gesture is called ‘Abhayamudra’ that offers protection for all from all evils. The upper right hand is shown holding a conch, ‘Shankha’ in Hindi. The sound of the conch is considered pious in Hinduism and represents the call to come and pray. The lower left hand holds a special sweet called ‘Modak or Laddoo’. It is believed that it is the favorite sweet of Lord Ganesha, also it represents the sweet result of prayers one offers and the sweetest things of all - The liberation or ‘Moksha’. Lakshmi is the Hindu goddess of wealth/money, prosperity, and fortune. Also she is the spouse of Lord Vishnu, who is believed to be the supreme savior of this universe. It is believed that worshipping goddess Lakshmi brings good luck, removes misery and poverty. Lakshmi is worshipped in Hinduism in homes and also at commercial establishments as the goddess of wealth for their success. The festival of Diwali in India sees special prayers in homes, commercial places and temples of goddess Lakshmi with Lord Ganesha. She also enjoys worship as the consort of Vishnu in many temples. The item is highly durable, elegant and a wonderful addition to your home decor. It can be readily turned into a wonderful Anniversary, Wedding, Diwali, Valentine gift item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lueUCG25L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Craftsman","source_asin":"B07XZ5QDJJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XZ5QDJJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XZ5QDJJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1143155,"name":"ELWEY Instant Read Meat Thermometer - Digital Food Thermometers for Kitchen Cooking and BBQ Grilling","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bkROrgoyL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"THE BEST INSTANT READ MEAT THERMOMETER Are you looking for the best to help you cook restaurant quality meals? Well, End your search with ELWEY digital meat thermometer. HERE’S WHY…. Amazing Features - Instant and accurate Read temperature accurately in 3-5 seconds - Auto-shut off Features The thermopop switches off if 10 minspass without activity. - Bright LCD Display Easily read accurate temperature on the electric 1.4 inches LCD screen. - BONUS calibration functions for increased measurement accuracy. HOW TO CALIBRATE Prepare a cup of ice and water mixture, press the hold button and put the probe into the cup for 5 seconds (make sure the probe touches the ice under water, Otherwise, you may get an \"ERR\" message if the temperature is not at freezing”) . The display will flash “CAL” on the screen, meaning it is correcting the temp reading to 32°F or 0°C. Once it shows 32°F or 0°C on the screen, the Calibration completes. CONVENIENT - Long collapsible probe : Ensuring you NEVER burn yourself when your try your food. - Easy to carry and Store : Features a magnetic function for placing on a refrigerator and a hanging hole for hooking. - Easy to clean : The probe is stainless for daily water resistance user experience. Product Specification Temperature Range:58 ℉ to 572 ℉(-50-300 ℃) Accuracy: ± 0.1 ℉ (between -4F to 392F) Probe Length: 4.4\" stainless steel probeBattery: 1 x CR2032 1.5V℉/℃ switchableDaily water resistance Package Included 1* ELWEY Grill Thermometer1* Manual2* CR2032 batteries The Kitchen Thermometer is backed by 100% MONEY BACK AND LIFETIME GUARANTEE Click “Add to Cart” Now, it is RISK-FREE!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bkROrgoyL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELWEY","source_asin":"B07F2H5KRZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F2H5KRZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F2H5KRZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
