window.products.push({"id":1143166,"name":"Sebo AUTOMATIC X4 Upright Vacuum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":849.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31G25dva8WL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Sebo Automatic X4 vacuum cleaner is a sturdy and lightweight upright vacuum that is made in Germany and has a 5 year warranty. It has many features to enhance your cleaning needs. Belt protection and suction motor protection are two features that extend the life of the vacuum. There is an automatic height adjustment feature that ensures optimal performance on both carpet and hard-floor surfaces. When you lower the handle flat, the low 5 ½ inch profile allows you to clean under beds and other furniture. There is a handy warning light that indicates whether your brush height is set too high for optimal cleaning or when the brush roller should be replaced due to bristle wear. There is also a Bag Full or Clog light with Automatic Shut Off which prevents overheating and motor damage from lack of adequate airflow. The wand and hose are very user-friendly and are ideal for cleaning furniture and stairs. The 40 foot cord reduces the number of electrical outlet changes needed during use. The brush roller is easily removed for cleaning; it requires no tools and ensures consistently effective brush agitation of the carpet. The Sebo Automatic X4 uses a large 1.4 gallon, disposable filter bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31G25dva8WL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sebo","source_asin":"B00FGBN8QQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FGBN8QQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FGBN8QQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1143167,"name":"Elecpioneev Yogurt Jar Lids Set, Bamboo Lids with Sunflower Pattern, Yogurt Jars Lids with Silicone Sealing Rings, Wooden Storage Lids Compatible with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DzNG060wL._AC_.jpg","description":"【Lids for Oui Yogurt Jars】: The oui yogurt jar lids are made of high-quality natural bamboo, which is food grade, environmental with plastic-free, non-toxic.You don't need to throw away the oui yogurt jar after you drink. It can withstand repeated using for countless times without deformation. 【Leak-Proof Airtight Storage】: Bamboo oui jar lids provide silicone sealing gasket with a good suction to help prevent leakage. It Keeps air out of oui jars and keeps contents dry. It will also keep away from dust and little bugs, allow you to fill the jars and keep the contents fresh for a long time. 【Easy To Clean And Durable】: The oui yogurt jar lid is easy to clean and reuse, won't rust or deform, and the removable silicone ring fits the oui jar easily.The lid is durable, will not rust or deform, it can be reused, wipe it off with a rag after use, put it in a ventilated place, keep it dry, which is good for the long-term use of the lids. 【Applications】: Nomally it can be used to store coffee, snacks, dried fruit, candy or nuts, cookies,store cereal, beans, rice, dry storage or spices, store screws and nails, pins and more.You can also use them for snacks in the car or for small items. It can easily satisfying your daily DIY requirements; You can also share them with your friends and family to experience the aesthetic ambience. 【Texture color difference】: Because bamboo is a natural material, its age, density and color are different. Like all bamboo products, these covers are made of bamboo pieces. Therefore, the eyelids may have some beautiful changes, including dark and light areas, spots and lines. Please embrace and enjoy the beauty of these natural changes! 【Package Include】: The oui jar lid is perfect for regular and small oui yogurt jars. Package includes 6/9 oui yogurt bamboo jar lids, 16 premium decorative blackboard labels, 1 white chalk marker.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DzNG060wL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elecpioneev","source_asin":"B0BFGF9NH3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFGF9NH3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFGF9NH3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
