window.products.push({"id":1143493,"name":"Backlit Arborescens by Amy Vangsgard, 18x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ep+FjljQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a bright red flower. Amy Vangsgard live in Los Angeles, CA. She graduated from Art Center College of Design. For over 20 years Amy has been an award winning free-lance illustrator. She has also taught design and illustration at Otis College of Art and Design. Amy had worked in many media: assemblage, clay, painting and digital arts. Amy uses both digital photography and digital painting techniques. Her inspiration comes from nature and succulent plants. She is fascinated with the way light illuminates objects and casts interesting shadows. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ep+FjljQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLYKWSO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLYKWSO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLYKWSO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1143494,"name":"NXHOME Metal-Frame Accent Wall Mirror - Decorative Mirror Gold Vanity Wall Mounted Mirror for Bathroom Living Room Bedroom 35.5×21.7 in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OnUX0wcFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GORGEOUS WELL BUILT MIRROR: This decorative mirror is designed with a recessed mirror surface. The mirror is recessed into the metal frame, it's floated from the frame edges and protected by the surrounding metal frame construction. The mirror comes with solid core wood backing and 3 -holes hooks for safety and stability. Hand polished edges ensure safety and beauty. The black metal frame adds elegance and class. Bring modern elegance to any space with this accent mirror! GREAT STURDY QUALITY: High-quality 4mm thick glass provides a clear distortion-free reflection, Will provide you really beautiful clear Portrait. The rounded corners lend a softness to the design. US SGS compliant MDF board, High-quality 7mm MDF backplane that ensures no harm to humans and prevents corrosion in the bathroom environment. SOPHISTICATED DESIGN: Instantly add depth and reflective beauty to any interior with this NXHOME Mirror. This striking handcrafted metal mirror is perfectly sized to fit most any space and comes ready to hang for easy installation. Its modern style is suitable for different living areas, such as bedrooms, bathrooms, halls, and entrances, etc. SAFE AND EASY TO INSTALL: The mirror is recessed within the frame so the frame protects the mirror from the bedroom door and bathroom door. It came with mounting hardware and was easy to install. 4 pre-installed reinforced D-ring hanging clips, as well as the wall hardware and screws, come with the mirror to hang it horizontally or vertically. 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE: If you meet any problems with the mirror, contact us without hesitation. If you don't like our product, let us know and receive a full, no questions asked refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OnUX0wcFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NXHOME","source_asin":"B09CD45H5J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CD45H5J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CD45H5J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1143495,"name":"RozeUp Handmade Floral Hoop Wreath - Set of 2 Small Wreaths for Indoor, Peony Wreath for Wall Decor and Door Décor, Nursery Wreath, Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8177Fh6PdnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorate like a professional: Hoop wreath and mini wreath set. Designed with versatility in mind. Created with a great attention to detail and high quality standard. Coming from a small business and home workshop. Play with arranging hoop wreath and small wreath in many ways. All year round This is not a peony wreath made only for your door. It is a unique floral arrangement to use indoor – outdoor. Our goal was to be PRETTY and VERSATILE to complement most of the popular styles like Farmhouse, Bohemian, French Country, Victorian, Whimsical, Woodland, and others. Decorate with multiple sets to create a theme, like experienced designers do. Use our wreaths to craft modern elegant venues or living spaces: ✓ Hanging flowers for boho living rooms and bedrooms ✓ Welcoming arrangement for apartment doors ✓ Floral nursery wall or girls room decor ✓ Unique holiday table centerpiece, candle ring or mantel decoration ✓ Rustic wedding backdrop or arch flowers ✓ Romantic wedding or baby photography prop ✓ Thoughtful gift for passionate decorators, Moms to be, Mother’s day, and other occasions Use our images to get ideas and try different ways to combine these two modern wreaths. You will find a satin ribbon helpful with hanging and gift wrapping. Product includes a small wreath and a hoop wreath shipped with the tie in the signature box. RozeUp is a women-owned business from Texas. All of our sales are celebrated as one step closer to our dreams coming true. We are involved in production of every single unit and your opinion is important to us. Happy to be available for all your questions and requests. If you are unsatisfied for any reason, we will make this right for you. No. Questions. Asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8177Fh6PdnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RozeUp","source_asin":"B08Z5S4SMN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z5S4SMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z5S4SMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
