window.products.push({"id":1143577,"name":"4 Stylish Stainless Steel Taco Holder Stand With Dressing Cup, Rack Holds Up to 3 Tacos Each, Oven Safe for Baking, Dishwasher and Grill Safe pack of ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IfpkcTg6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you still serving your tacos on plates and trays? Tacos, by design, are a pretty messy dish. Between the cheese, ground beef and veggies, there’s just too many ingredients to accidentally spill en route to the dining table. Couple this with the fact that taco shells are not really meant to stand upright and your odds of keeping your tacos intact drop even more. Don’t you ever wish there was a way to more easily handle your tacos? Wouldn’t it be better if you could serve them without 50% of their filling ending up on the plate or serving tray? Serve your tacos like a pro with the Zara Concepts Taco Holder Stand Set! Expertly crafted using high-quality stainless steel, our stylish professional-grade taco serving racks are designed to effectively keep your taco shells perfectly upright—and their filling intact—from the kitchen all the way to the dining table. They’re also specifically crafted to be 100% safe for use with either your oven or grill, so you can prepare your tacos exactly the way you want. Why let your taco holders dictate the way your meal comes out, right? You can also use them to make your tacos easier to transport when you go on hikes, camping trips, picnics, beach trips and other outdoor activities with your family or friends. Finally, when you’re done using them, you can just throw them in the dishwasher along with the rest of your other plates and utensils. There’s no need to wash anything by hand. How’s that for convenience? ✅ Stable, durable design ✅ Made with 100% food-grade stainless steel ✅ Stackable construction for easy storage Give yourself the gift of mess-free tacos! Add the Zara Concepts Taco Holder Stand Set to your cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IfpkcTg6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zara concepts","source_asin":"B07GB4X63B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143577","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GB4X63B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GB4X63B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
