window.products.push({"id":1143590,"name":"Windy Hill Collection 18\" Fuchsia & Orange Fleur de lis Tabletop Fabric Halloween Fall Harvest Witch Collectible Figure Figurine 911807","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VYM4V6E6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fuchsia & Orange Witch looks almost like a cross between a benevolent Halloween witch and a Fairy Godmother. She certainly has magic powers to mesmerize you with her style and elegance. Her classic orange skirt has a bold black fleur de lis pattern. Her shirt has a sparkling fuchsia color that radiates along her princess cuff sleeves. The purple boa wrapped around her neck matches with the black sheer fabric and purple sequin ribbon tied at her waist beneath a crystal medallion. Her black wood broom with hidden orange glitter on the brush fibers highlights her well-manicured maroon finger nail polish. Her salt & pepper gray curly hair is under a matching orange hat with a metal golden glitter smiling orange pumpkin tassel, black ribbon, purple and black feathers, and it just barely hides the large wart on the side of her nose. Not quite sure if that look on her face is either about to scold you for being naughty or burst into fits of laughter! She can stand stable on any flat surface, or rest on a pole because her base is a plastic cone (similar to Christmas Angel tree toppers), what flexibility! Fuchsia & Orange Witch will spread her magic and style into your home this season.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VYM4V6E6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Windy Hill Collection","source_asin":"B086R8SJP1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086R8SJP1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086R8SJP1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1143591,"name":"Tafts Home Waffle Turkish Beach Towel (37 x 69) - Prewashed Turkish Towels, 100% Long Staple Cotton - Super Absorbent, Quick Dry Towels and Ultra Soft","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81efT6BEE9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER ABSORBENT AND FAST DRYING - Tafts Home Turkish Towels are made with 100% turkish long staple cotton. Turkish towels are thinner than regular towels but are highly absorbent. They are also incredibly fast-drying and ultra soft. Tafts Home Turkish Towels are a necessity when going to the pool or relaxing at the beach. UNIQUE DESIGN - The Waffle Weave towel is a modern Turkish design which has 3-D waffle weave, giving it a soft feel and a visually-pleasing aesthetic . Like all of our towels, the Waffle is extremely versatile and can be used as a throw, shawl, scarf, wrap, and many more. MULTI-PURPOSE - At 37\" x 69\", our Turkish towels are super lightweight and compact. Perfect for traveling by plane or by car. You can use it by the pool, at your gym, or on a hike. It also doesn't hold sand, making it perfect as a beach blanket or towel. MACHINE WASHABLE - Just throw those towels in the washer on cold. DO not use fabric softener. Tumble dry on low or air dry. 30 DAY GUARANTEED - Every Tafts Home Turkish towel comes with a 30-day money back guarantee, so just send us a message and we will be more than happy to help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81efT6BEE9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tafts","source_asin":"B08KSLJQGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KSLJQGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KSLJQGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
