window.products.push({"id":1143720,"name":"Zinus Ultima Comfort Mattress, Twin XL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dOD4XmuPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The quality of your sleep can affect every area of your life, let us help you get your best nights sleep with our 8\" memory foam mattress and Bi-Fold box spring twin XL set. The 8-inch Sleep Master memory foam mattress offers comfort and support. The top layer, 2 Inch of our memory foam that is infused with Evergreen and ActivCharcol ingredients. Evergreen is a green tea extract that naturally neutralizes odors from day one, while ActivCharcol is made from purified charcoal that absorbs moisture minimizing odor-causing agents. The next 2\" layer is our super soft foam that is ventilated in the areas that hit key pressure points on the body - neck and shoulders, hips and feet. A 4-inch high-density foam base provides the perfect amount of support to ensure that you get a refreshing nights sleep. Sleep Master embraces the idea of \"Sleep Green\", the comfort of your sleep environment is balanced with ingredients that are safer for you and the environment. We use Bio Foam in all our mattresses, made with natural seed oil this minimizes the use of petrol based chemical oils. Additionally, all of our mattresses are CertiPUR-US certified. You can rest assured knowing that your mattress has gone through the most rigorous and comprehensive testing in the industry. The Bi-Fold box spring was designed for mobility and functionality. Traditional box springs are hard to maneuver through your home and often scrape walls and doors. The Bi-Fold box spring ships in a box and the setup is easy - simply unfold the box spring and lay your mattress on top. A non-skid fabric on top keeps you mattress in place so that you don't have to worry about constantly re-adjusting your mattress. No tools are required for assembly. We strive to help everyone experience a rejuvenating and relaxing night of sleep. The mattress comes with a limited 5-year warranty and the Bi-Fold box spring comes with a limited 1-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dOD4XmuPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zinus","source_asin":"B007IO12VC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007IO12VC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007IO12VC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
