window.products.push({"id":1143781,"name":"Lacoste Croc Beach Towels, 36\" W x 72\" L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nyuBr-5nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gradient shades of blue, navy, and black fade across this beautiful beach towel in vertical ombre stripes. The iconic Lacoste crocodile appears in the corner for a touch of signature style. This beach towel is made from soft sheared cotton velvet and reverses to an absorbent cotton terry. Soak in the sun with the iconic style of Lacoste beach towels this summer. While most beach towels are made from low-quality microfiber, these extra-large towels are made from a premium sheared velvet crafted from 100% cotton. This creates an incredibly soft handfeel that leaves you feeling relaxed after a day of swimming, boating, or any other water-side activity. The reverse is a traditional terry cloth, also made from 100% cotton. This material adds to the absorbency of the towel, making it quick and easy to dry off after a day of fun. These towels are incredibly light, so it’s easy to pack them up with the rest of your beach gear. Roll them up, fold them up, or throw them into the car seat they travel with you no matter where the adventure takes you. Lay them out on the sand, onto a foldable beach chair, by the pool, or on the boat deck. No matter where life takes you, Lacoste beach towels keep you dry, comfortable, and living in style. Lacoste beach towels come in multiple styles and colors, and always feature a creative take on the signature and instantly recognizable crocodile logo. They are appropriate for anyone from kids to teens to adults, boys, girls, men, women, and anyone in between. No matter what your personal style, Lacoste has a color and design to meet your beach, boat, or poolside needs. These beach towels can be easily washed in a washing machine. Even better is that they have minimal linting, keeping your washer and dryer clean and your skin lint-free. The vibrant colors stay true and do not fade, even after multiple washings. Enjoy the premium quality of Lacoste beach towels time and time again. About Lacoste: Following our core values of optimism and elegance, we pave the way in everything from our iconic polo shirts to premium bedding and luxury bathroom décor. Our constant search for excellence is reflected in the high-quality, modern collections we design, create, and market. Enter the world of Lacoste and share in our vision of casual elegance, optimism, and faith in the future. Package Includes: One (1) Lacoste Beach Towel Size: 36\"W x 72\"L GSM: 390 Face Material: 100% cotton velvet Reverse Material: 100% cotton terrycloth","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nyuBr-5nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lacoste","source_asin":"B0837J5GNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1143781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0837J5GNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0837J5GNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
